{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>NEODITRONIX</i> is the dreamcore rhythm experience, available as a web-based, standalone freeware title. <strong>HEAR</strong> various sounds with frenetic rhythm gameplay, utilizing unique lane lasers. <strong>RECOLLECT</strong> memories with a full narrative exploring lost dreams.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KINETIC RHYTHMIC ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782120/extras/9148ab6f66b1a579f2c252c228d3fe56.avif?t=1766646865\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge yourself</strong> with traditional rhythm arcade 4k action, flipped upside down with a unique lane-shifting mechanic. Use your mouse to move the lanes along the line while handling the 4 lanes simultaneously! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 3 (<i>?</i>) different difficulties: Lite, Neon, and Enigma, for those looking to set the adversity to their liking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A HAUNTING, DREAMY ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782120/extras/8fb5516145aedb12a821682d8d85209a.avif?t=1766646865\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the dreamworld.</strong> Awake in a spaceship with no memories and a strange, mysterious companion in tow, hear <strong>Shiro</strong>'s past in  2D side-scrolling vignettes in the Adventure mode. Uncover the secrets of Shiro's past and the universe surrounding him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A love letter to rhythm games, narrative games, and the SKY HOUR WORKS doujin circle, published as a part of our\u00a0 6th anniversary!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including playable tracks from takehirotei, Tatsuoto, Kyotsugyon, DeBisco, Frums, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future updates will include new story content, accessibility features, playable tracks, and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >creature</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"This is your dream.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782120/125a5fe6fe735c603a830916a71588d116f339d0.jpg"},{"name":"I'm sorry, Shiro.. ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782120/5b77841bc8faecfc2479d236a8b340213bfc048b.jpg"},{"name":"Everything is going to be okay.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782120/330ddb56468c99dc063d1ca3148ef065529e59e8.jpg"},{"name":"Fever Dream.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782120/b95f64f9fff1a0aa7fe306acd5c154364972d3ff.jpg"},{"name":"This is a good night.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782120/f1e6d38017c0da956a8995e1344ea22a3212f705.jpg"},{"name":"Miracle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782120/a5f13ac4510833621d8f8d1b02c600156de29894.jpg"},{"name":"Professional Dreamer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782120/70b366e4c79a87f30a995670d3740ea06a0e6c84.jpg"},{"name":"Over the top.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782120/edc92031e12acdde677da00b18895231b66be849.jpg"},{"name":"Coffee Drinker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782120/b8c7c33de8ab7bfc2fe58a4525309f2cc3d893f9.jpg"},{"name":"Investor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3782120/58004ac9762a89e1d967569ca16e074c2629b6d3.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3782120?t=1766646865","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782120/529368aefe43b0f5acfe416afacb2b082b926f04/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766646865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782120/d3f49b96a9167c13beaf0e022b63cc4fbd225d3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766646865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782120/d3f49b96a9167c13beaf0e022b63cc4fbd225d3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766646865","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains elements of psychological horror that may be disturbing to some players. Aspects of this game's story touch upon themes like the following.\r\n\r\n- Characters having a mental breakdown, traumatized, mentally tortured.\r\n- The story content depicts themes such as childhood trauma, amnesia, suicide, depression, and parental violence.\r\n- Part of the story's content covers the theme of a mass disastrous incident, post-apocalyptic world, death, grief, mourning, loss, and loneliness.\r\n- The game contains themes related to the concept of 4th wall breaking."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>NEODITRONIX</i> is the dreamcore rhythm experience, available as a web-based, standalone freeware title. <strong>HEAR</strong> various sounds with frenetic rhythm gameplay, utilizing unique lane lasers. <strong>RECOLLECT</strong> memories with a full narrative exploring lost dreams.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KINETIC RHYTHMIC ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782120/extras/9148ab6f66b1a579f2c252c228d3fe56.avif?t=1766646865\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge yourself</strong> with traditional rhythm arcade 4k action, flipped upside down with a unique lane-shifting mechanic. Use your mouse to move the lanes along the line while handling the 4 lanes simultaneously! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 3 (<i>?</i>) different difficulties: Lite, Neon, and Enigma, for those looking to set the adversity to their liking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A HAUNTING, DREAMY ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782120/extras/8fb5516145aedb12a821682d8d85209a.avif?t=1766646865\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the dreamworld.</strong> Awake in a spaceship with no memories and a strange, mysterious companion in tow, hear <strong>Shiro</strong>'s past in  2D side-scrolling vignettes in the Adventure mode. Uncover the secrets of Shiro's past and the universe surrounding him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A love letter to rhythm games, narrative games, and the SKY HOUR WORKS doujin circle, published as a part of our\u00a0 6th anniversary!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including playable tracks from takehirotei, Tatsuoto, Kyotsugyon, DeBisco, Frums, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future updates will include new story content, accessibility features, playable tracks, and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >creature</p></li></ul>","developers":["log()"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta